    /**
     * Update software update behavior.
     *
     * This function modifies a server's `/etc/cpupdate.conf` file. This file controls how the server
     * handles software updates and upgrades.
     *
     * @param  string|null  $cpanel  The cPanel & WHM installation's release tier, or a valid version number.
     * @param  string|null  $rpmup  The frequency with which the server updates the operating system distribution's packages each time that the `/usr/local/cpanel/scripts/upcp` script runs.
